{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたーーん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーーーーお家着いて昨日も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"半身浴して(バスソルト混入済)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャスミン茶置きながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ書いてるよ◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑やっぱりお風呂が１番集中して書ける（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の握手会はいつもとは違くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンの装飾が派手だったり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗なお花が飾ってあったり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の方からのお祝いメッセージを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頂いた1日になりました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕委員の皆さん、そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斉藤優里の生誕祭に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも携わって下さった皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忙しい中、大切な時間を費やして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くれてありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2016/07/11/3151386/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨年よりも去年、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年よりも今年！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大勢の方にそして大きな規模で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日お祝いして頂いています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂自体が大きくなっていっているので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有り難いことに握手会会場に沢山の方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれていることが多くなってきているけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貢献出来ているかな？って考えた時、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"微々たる力しかないのも実感しています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私に出来ることってなんだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にしか出来ないことってなんだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他の誰でもなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斉藤優里にしか出来ないこと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと必要とされるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思ってるだけでは伝わらないので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分から発信していきたいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな風に新たな決意を感じれた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕祭でもありました！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕記念で作って頂いたプレゼントの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真集...私の夢の中の１つでもあり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな形で叶えて頂いて本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったです( ˙˘˙ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に嬉しくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんに自慢しちゃいました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ちゃんと値段を付けて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂46の斉藤優里」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"としていつか出版してもらえるまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"諦めません！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"br